    "title": {
      "type": "i18n",
      "default_language": "en",
      "values": {
        "en": "First Fundamental Coefficient E",
        "zh-CN": "第一基本形式系数 E"
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "snl": "variable[default](__list__[default]($\\mathcal C_X$@DG.ctxt.surfaceParametrization,DG.def.regularParametrizedSurface[text](X,$\\Omega$),Type.annotation[colon](@q,LA.def.realVecSpaceRn[default]($2$)),Set.Mem[default](LA.def.realVecSpaceRn[default]($2$),$\\Omega$,q)),def[untyped](Type.apply[paren](DG.firstFundamentalE[default](X),q),Real[default],inner[default](Type.apply[paren](DG.def.partialDeriv[default](X,$1$),q),Type.apply[paren](DG.def.partialDeriv[default](X,$1$),q))))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "Let $\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2$ be Euclidean open and $X:\\mathbb R^2\\to\\mathbb R^3$ be smooth and regular on $\\Omega$. At $q\\in\\Omega$, put $U=X_u(q)$ and $V=X_v(q)$; these form a basis of $T_qX$. Define $E_X(q)=\\langle U,U\\rangle$.",
          "zh-CN": "设 $\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2$ 为欧氏开集，$X:\\mathbb R^2\\to\\mathbb R^3$ 在 $\\Omega$ 上光滑且正则。取 $q\\in\\Omega$，记 $U=X_u(q)$、$V=X_v(q)$，它们构成 $T_qX$ 的一组基。定义 $E_X(q)=\\langle U,U\\rangle$。"
        }
      }
    },
